      "source": "An implementation of both a <a href=\"Schema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core.mapping\"><code>Schema</code></a> as well as a Neo4j version of Spring Data's\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>. It is recommended to\nprovide the initial set of classes through <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/AbstractMappingContext.html#setInitialEntitySet(java.util.Set)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>AbstractMappingContext.setInitialEntitySet(Set)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "同时实现了 <a href=\"Schema.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.neo4j.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>Schema</code></a> 以及 Spring Data 的 Neo4j 版本 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.context 中的类或接口\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>。建议通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/AbstractMappingContext.html#setInitialEntitySet(java.util.Set)\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.context 中的类或接口\"><code>AbstractMappingContext.setInitialEntitySet(Set)</code></a> 提供初始类集。",
