    {
      "source": "We need to set the context to non-strict in case we must dynamically add parent\nclasses.",
      "translation": "我们需要将上下文设置为非严格模式，以便在必要时动态添加父类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "We need to set the context to non-strict in case we must dynamically add parent\nclasses. As there is no way to access the original value without reflection, we\ntrack its change.",
      "translation": "我们需要将上下文设置为非严格模式，以便在必要时动态添加父类。由于无法在不使用反射的情况下访问原始值，因此我们追踪其变化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
